lues": ["墨匠1: 今日立春。看着窗外的树都在拼命发芽，可回头一看，家里的高中生却趴在桌上，死气沉沉。叫他起来，他一脸起床气；让他做题，他眼神发直。你以为他变懒了？其实不是。俗话说“春困秋乏”。春天，身体所有的能量都在忙着“生长”，忙着长个儿、忙着代谢。这就导致了一个问题：供给大脑的血液和氧气，相对不足了。这在生理学上叫“生长性缺氧”。孩子觉得累、觉得困，那是身体在发出信号：“妈，我的油箱空了，快给我加油。”如果这时候还要逼着他靠意志力硬扛，只会两败俱伤。懂科学的妈妈，懂得“借力”。\n墨匠1: 我给他的春日方案是：一杯温热的柠檬水，搭配这份爱曲美特膳耐力补给。它是国家标准的运动营养食品。就像给干渴的植物浇透了水，精准补充耐力因子。看着他喝下去，深呼吸，那种滞涩的感觉消失了，眼神重新变得清澈。身体舒展了，脑子也就通透了。早读的声音，都比平时响亮了几分。春天是生长的季节，不是睡觉的季节。抓住这个窗口期，帮孩子把耐力底盘筑牢。像拔节的竹子一样向上吧，少年。妈妈会为你，守好这一方春暖花开。", "1.7B", "auto", "bf16", "Auto", 0.5, 0.4, 0.2, 0.6, 0.3, true, 4, 366425160870572, "randomize", 2048, 0.8, 20, 1, 1.05, "auto", false], "inputs": [{"name": "role_bank", "link": 103, "label": "role_bank", "type": "QWEN3_ROLE_BANK", "localized_name": "role_bank"}, {"widget": {"name": "script"}, "name": "script", "label": "script", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "script"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_choice"}, "name": "model_choice", "label": "model_choice", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_choice"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "precision"}, "name": "precision", "label": "precision", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "precision"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "pause_linebreak"}, "name": "pause_linebreak", "label": "pause_linebreak", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "pause_linebreak"}, {"widget": {"name": "period_pause"}, "name": "period_pause", "label": "period_pause", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "period_pause"}, {"widget": {"name": "comma_pause"}, "name": "comma_pause", "label": "comma_pause", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "comma_pause"}, {"widget": {"name": "question_pause"}, "name": "question_pause", "label": "question_pause", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "question_pause"}, {"widget": {"name": "hyphen_pause"}, "name": "hyphen_pause", "label": "hyphen_pause", "type": "FLOA